{"id":"dfc13419e9fde542","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-compatible-order.md","title":"df-compatible-order","display":"df-compatible-order","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-compatible-order","aliases":["56-df-compatible-order"],"display":"df-compatible-order","type":"definition","depends_on":["[[56-df-reduction-order]]"],"source_section":"6.5.48 (related construction); local formal abbreviation","source_pages":"253","source_ocr_blocks":[274],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-compatible-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-compatible-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-compatible-order"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea6d0d000271b1cf\" href=\"?note=ea6d0d000271b1cf\" title=\"56-df-reduction-order\">56-df-reduction-order</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.5.48 (related construction); local formal abbreviation"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"253"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>274</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\succeq,&gt;\\subseteq A^2\">\\(\\succeq,&gt;\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,&gt;)\">\\(\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,&gt;)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea6d0d000271b1cf\" href=\"?note=ea6d0d000271b1cf\" title=\"56-df-reduction-order\">56-df-reduction-order</a>。本节点引入二元关系对的代数兼容条件；它不是规则定向谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compatible}(R,&gt;)\">\\(\\mathrm{Compatible}(R,&gt;)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Preorder}(A,\\succeq)&amp;\\iff\n(\\forall a\\in A\\;a\\succeq a)\\land\n(\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;(a\\succeq b\\land b\\succeq c\\Rightarrow a\\succeq c)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CompatPair}(A,\\succeq,&gt;)&amp;\\iff\n\\mathrm{Preorder}(A,\\succeq)\\land\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,&gt;)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall a,b,c,d\\in A\\;\n(a\\succeq b\\land b&gt;c\\land c\\succeq d\\Rightarrow a&gt;d).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Preorder}(A,\\succeq)&amp;\\iff\n(\\forall a\\in A\\;a\\succeq a)\\land\n(\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;(a\\succeq b\\land b\\succeq c\\Rightarrow a\\succeq c)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CompatPair}(A,\\succeq,&gt;)&amp;\\iff\n\\mathrm{Preorder}(A,\\succeq)\\land\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,&gt;)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall a,b,c,d\\in A\\;\n(a\\succeq b\\land b&gt;c\\land c\\succeq d\\Rightarrow a&gt;d).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是保留旧稿意图的本地关系缩写，而非声称原书以 CompatPair 命名此对象。原书 Definition 6.5.48 的 reduction quasi-ordering 以同一个拟序的严格部分处理下降；其严格部分自动满足这里的吸收条件。这里尚未要求替换稳定性、上下文封闭性或良基性，因此不能仅凭 CompatPair 推出终止。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.5.48 (related construction); local formal abbreviation，印刷页 253。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-reduction-order","status":"resolved","id":"ea6d0d000271b1cf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-reduction-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-order","status":"resolved","id":"ea6d0d000271b1cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A$ 为集合，$\\succeq,>\\subseteq A^2$，$\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,>)$ 见 [[56-df-reduction-order]]。本节点引入二元关系对的代数兼容条件；它不是规则定向谓词 $\\mathrm{Compatible}(R,>)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\succeq,>\\subseteq A^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,>)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compatible}(R,>)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Preorder}(A,\\succeq)&\\iff\n(\\forall a\\in A\\;a\\succeq a)\\land\n(\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;(a\\succeq b\\land b\\succeq c\\Rightarrow a\\succeq c)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CompatPair}(A,\\succeq,>)&\\iff\n\\mathrm{Preorder}(A,\\succeq)\\land\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,>)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall a,b,c,d\\in A\\;\n(a\\succeq b\\land b>c\\land c\\succeq d\\Rightarrow a>d).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1735,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-207","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-compatible-order.md]]"}],"outgoing":["ea6d0d000271b1cf"]}